      "writtenOn": "2025-10-27T21:24:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm I\u0027m fine with either, but I think the main reason it\u0027s not clearer is probably because the name `OnStagingMemoryFreePendingOnSubmit` is fairly confusing. (Though I unfortunately don\u0027t have a better alternative atm...)\n\nThe main motivation for the change from my side is to try to remove as many sites that call `GetPendingCommandSerial()` directly because I believe that the way we are handling those serials is a major source of inconveniences for making some more multithread changes. If instead of querying for those serials inline, we vended them out earlier, we could potentially scope a lot of the critical sections to be tighter in the future.",
